# HERMES Masterclasses

This repository contains the HERMES Masterclasses educational website built
with Quarto and published to GitHub Pages via GitHub Actions.

## Local preview

1. Install Quarto: https://quarto.org/docs/get-started/
2. Preview the site:

```
quarto preview
```

## Publish

Publishing is automated. Any push to `main` triggers the GitHub Actions workflow
to build and deploy the site to the `gh-pages` branch.

## Structure

- `_quarto.yml`: site configuration
- `index.qmd`: homepage
- `about-hermes.qmd`: HERMES experiment overview
- `physics-basics.qmd`: introductory physics page
- `mission-*.qmd`: mission pages
- `analysis-lab.qmd`: future analysis area
- `results.qmd`: future results area
- `teachers.qmd`: teacher and tutor resources
